{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014-plan-r1\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"route\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"5a1855482e92a2de4f028ffa106b9dfccde89a50\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002030\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014/plan-review-package-r1.txt\": \"232e78508d36299650e78badf0c3b904892e200619e5d7a73ff9916421cc1ce1\"}}, \"claims\": [\"前端方案区分成功空与读取失败，暂存草稿不当当前权威，失败或加载中禁止命令及history恢复，入口guard早于请求键和调用。\", \"方案保留编辑字段和已发生Receipt及未知请求键，恢复仅从新read成功建立当前状态，原正常流程和旧相邻行为不改。\", \"当前仅方案拟稿，不是业务批准、已实现/浏览器验收或完整Goal完成。\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014/plan-review-package-r1.txt\": \"PROSPECTIVE UI plan only, product unchanged. Target stale authority correctness/command deny, no new command approval. Whole Goal preserved.\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014/registration.json SHA a595e101c47ccebc466a64dfccb8f1af45a8499b6ccad89194fb343302d27b6b\\n{\\n  \\\"schema\\\": \\\"aos-memory-task-receipt/v1\\\",\\n  \\\"task_id\\\": \\\"qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014\\\",\\n  \\\"owner\\\": \\\"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\\\",\\n  \\\"base_revision\\\": \\\"AOS-002030\\\",\\n  \\\"scope\\\": [\\n    \\\"aos-platform/apps/web/src/components/workshop/CreatorGrowthPage.tsx\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/apps/web/src/components/workshop/CreatorGrowthPage.test.tsx\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/.evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"excluded_scope\\\": [\\n    \\\"aos-platform/apps/web/src/styles\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/services/aos-api\\\",\\n    \\\"aos-platform/maintenance/qiyuehui-restored-data-volume\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"expected_outputs\\\": [\\n    \\\"Exact source-co